  )
  (text "BMS BQ40Z50-R2\n- Proteksi high-side: Q6 (CHG) + Q7 (DSG) common-drain. PACK_P = sisi charger/sistem.\n- Sense 1mOhm low-side: BATT_N (cell -) -> R44 -> GND sistem. VSS IC = BATT_N (sisi SRP).\n- SMBus alamat 0x0B ke bus I2C MCU (100 kHz).\n- TS1 = NTC cell (J4), TS2 = NTC PCB (TH1), TS3/TS4 tidak dipakai -> set di data flash.\n- Pin VC yang tidak dipakai di-short oleh SW1 pos5-7 (sheet charger).\n- Konfigurasi awal 1S/2S: colok USB-C dulu supaya PACK ada tegangan (lihat datasheet 9.2.1).\n- VERIFIKASI vs BQ40Z50EVM: koneksi VCC (di sini ke node tengah FET) dan R49." (at 230 22.86 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "d8257363-371f-5692-9ed2-eb38d999b4c5")
  )
)
